<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Lab Script Download</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      padding: 20px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .card {
      border: 1px solid #ccc;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }
    code {
      background: #f4f4f4;
      padding: 2px 6px;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    a.button {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 15px;
      padding: 10px 16px;
      background: #0b57d0;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }
    a.button:hover {
      background: #0842a0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h1>Training Lab Script</h1>
    <p>
      Download the harmless demo script below for shell scripting practice.
    </p>

    <a class="button" href="demo_fetch.sh" download>Download demo_fetch.sh</a>

    <h2>How to run</h2>
    <p>After downloading, open a terminal and run:</p>
    <pre><code>chmod +x demo_fetch.sh
./demo_fetch.sh</code></pre>

    <h2>What it does</h2>
    <p>
      This demo script clears the terminal and prints a simple test message.
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
